# Kimi K2.8 Preview — findings by Qwen 3.8 27B (SELF-EXCLUDED)

- Source: MoonshotAI (`kimi-k2.8-preview`)
- Date: 2026-09-29 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Kimi K2.8 Preview
- **Short description:** Moonshot AI's mid-tier coding/agentic preview checkpoint (Sept 2026), positioned between the coding-focused Kimi K2.7 Code and the flagship Kimi K3; closed/proprietary, a departure from the open-weight K2.7 Code and K3.
- **Provider / access:** Moonshot first-party API + Kimi Code / Kimi Work apps; same API model ID as K2.7 Code (`kimi-for-coding`), so existing clients pick it up without config changes. Third-party gateway: TokenRa. No OpenCode Zen Free ID verified in this pass.
- **Release / knowledge:** released 2026-09-11 (Moonshot via KuCoin/PANews reporting, llm-stats); knowledge cutoff not disclosed.
- **IDs:** `moonshotai/kimi-k2.8-preview` (OpenCode data compare page); API id `kimi-for-coding` (shared with K2.7 Code). Proprietary — no open weights.
- **Context window:** 1M total on every Kimi Code membership tier, up from 262,144 on K2.7 Code (Moonshot announcement via KuCoin flash; llm-stats confirms 1.0M).
- **Modalities:** text / image / video in, text out; reasoning yes — three thinking-effort levels (low / high / max), max by default.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-29):** no official first-party API pricing published for the preview as of 2026-09-15; gateway TokenRa lists ~$0.80 in / $3.35 out / $0.14 cached in per 1M (indicator only, not an official rate card).
- **Architecture:** not disclosed (proprietary); MoE family (K2.7 Code / K3 are MoE) — unverified for this exact checkpoint.

